{
    "title": "Tappytoon Manhwa & Novels",
    "description": "<b> Discover top comics and novels on Tappytoon\u2122 - your official source\r\nfor original manhwa, manga and webtoon by top creators! </b>\r\n\r\n\r\nFeaturing latest chapters of popular action comics such as <i>Solo Leveling</i>, <i>The Skeleton Soldier</i>, <i>I'm the\r\nMax-Level Newbie</i>, and fantasy comics like <i>I Became the Mother of the Evil Male Lead</i>, <i>Born\r\nas the Second Daughter,</i>, <i>The Beloved Little Princess</i>, <i>I Woke Up as the Ugly Duckling</i>.\r\n \r\nCatch up on romantic bestsellers <i>Ashtarte</i>, <i>The Empress Wants To Avoid the Emperor</i>,<i>The Broken Ring: This Marriage Will Fail Anyway</i>,  and Popular new romance releases such as <i>I Became the Tyrant's Dishonest \r\nAdviser</i> and <i>The Villainess Empress's Attendant</i>. \r\nIf you are looking for BL, Tappytoon has it all.\r\n<i>Cherry Blossoms After Winter</i>, <i>DEAR. DOOR</i> ,  <i>My Darling Signed In</i>and <i>How to Snag an Alpha</i> are all available for your reading.\r\n\r\nWebnovel adaptations <i>Who Made Me a Princess</i> and <i>What It Takes to be a Villainess</i> are also here.\r\n \r\n\u25ba <b>Only at Tappytoon</b>\r\n- Time Till Free (TTF) lets you read free chapter every 24 hours, hand-picked by our staff\r\n- HD Mode makes it possible to read your favroite comics in stunning HD quality\r\n- Exclusive on-going deals only for Tappytoon members\r\n- Tappytoon Club Membership makes it easy to top-up points and add perks to make reading more affordable\r\n\r\n\u25ba <b>Unlock chapters with points</b>\r\nSupport artists, authors and creators by purchasing and earn free points.\r\nAccess your unlocked webtoon, manhwa and novel chapters to read anywhere, anytime with your own library, linked with your Tappytoon account. \r\n\r\n\u25ba <b>New chapters everyday</b>\r\nTappytoon's comic and manhwa collection spans across action, romance, fantasy, BL and drama. There's comics for everyone.\r\nDon't forget to check out our webnovel collection. \r\n\r\n\u25ba <b>Official updates of exclusive comics and webnovels</b>\r\nDive into an amazing story!\r\nTappytoon is the official place to read manhwa, webtoon, manga, webnovel\r\nyou won't find anywhere else.\r\n\r\n\u25ba <b>Not quite ready to binge?</b>\r\nExplore with free chapters and no sign-up until you're ready.\r\nAnd when you are, signing up will grant you access to exclusive deals available only at Tappytoon.\r\n\r\n\u25ba <b>Free tickets to try a new comic</b>\r\nClaim tickets to unlock even more chapters of comics, novels and webtoons that you might have missed.\r\n\r\n\u25ba <b>Never miss a chapter</b>\r\nSubscribe to your favorite stories and we\u2019ll always let you know when a new chapter becomes available. Sort & Filter in comics and novels in Daily, Genre, Library sections.\r\n \r\nDownload now and jump right in to most vibrant comic, manhwa community!\r\n\r\n<b>Follow Tappytoon\u2122 on Instagram, Twitter(X), Tiktok, Facebook and YouTube! </b>\r\n- Instagram: https://instagram.com/Tappy_toon\r\n- Twitter: https://twitter.com/Tappy_toon\r\n- Tiktok: https://www.tiktok.com/@tappytoon_official\r\n- Facebook: https://facebook.com/Tappytoon\r\n- https://www.youtube.com/c/Tappytoon\r\n\r\n*Time Till Free is available only on select eligible comics/chapters. \r\nEligibility may change at Tappytoon's discretion.\r\n\r\n*Tappytoon Club Membership subscription automatically renews unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the current period ends. \r\nYour account will be charged the same price for renewal within 24-hours \r\nbefore the current subscription period ends. You can turn off auto-renewal at anytime. See the Tappytoon Club Membership page on app for more details.\r\n\r\nComics and webtoons are only available in English, French, German language at this time.\r\nNovels (webnovels) are only available in English language at this time.\r\n---\r\n**Email support: support[@]tappytoon.com\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://www.tappytoon.com/terms\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.tappytoon.com/terms/privacy\r\n---\r\nAll content on Tappytoon is serviced in official partnership with the respective publishers, creators and artists. \r\n\u00a9 Tappytoon\u2122 - All rights reserved.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b> Discover top comics and novels on Tappytoon\u2122 - your official source<br>for original manhwa, manga and webtoon by top creators! </b><br><br><br>Featuring latest chapters of popular action comics such as <i>Solo Leveling</i>, <i>The Skeleton Soldier</i>, <i>I&#39;m the<br>Max-Level Newbie</i>, and fantasy comics like <i>I Became the Mother of the Evil Male Lead</i>, <i>Born<br>as the Second Daughter,</i>, <i>The Beloved Little Princess</i>, <i>I Woke Up as the Ugly Duckling</i>.<br> <br>Catch up on romantic bestsellers <i>Ashtarte</i>, <i>The Empress Wants To Avoid the Emperor</i>,<i>The Broken Ring: This Marriage Will Fail Anyway</i>,  and Popular new romance releases such as <i>I Became the Tyrant&#39;s Dishonest <br>Adviser</i> and <i>The Villainess Empress&#39;s Attendant</i>. <br>If you are looking for BL, Tappytoon has it all.<br><i>Cherry Blossoms After Winter</i>, <i>DEAR. DOOR</i> ,  <i>My Darling Signed In</i>and <i>How to Snag an Alpha</i> are all available for your reading.<br><br>Webnovel adaptations <i>Who Made Me a Princess</i> and <i>What It Takes to be a Villainess</i> are also here.<br> <br>\u25ba <b>Only at Tappytoon</b><br>- Time Till Free (TTF) lets you read free chapter every 24 hours, hand-picked by our staff<br>- HD Mode makes it possible to read your favroite comics in stunning HD quality<br>- Exclusive on-going deals only for Tappytoon members<br>- Tappytoon Club Membership makes it easy to top-up points and add perks to make reading more affordable<br><br>\u25ba <b>Unlock chapters with points</b><br>Support artists, authors and creators by purchasing and earn free points.<br>Access your unlocked webtoon, manhwa and novel chapters to read anywhere, anytime with your own library, linked with your Tappytoon account. <br><br>\u25ba <b>New chapters everyday</b><br>Tappytoon&#39;s comic and manhwa collection spans across action, romance, fantasy, BL and drama. There&#39;s comics for everyone.<br>Don&#39;t forget to check out our webnovel collection. <br><br>\u25ba <b>Official updates of exclusive comics and webnovels</b><br>Dive into an amazing story!<br>Tappytoon is the official place to read manhwa, webtoon, manga, webnovel<br>you won&#39;t find anywhere else.<br><br>\u25ba <b>Not quite ready to binge?</b><br>Explore with free chapters and no sign-up until you&#39;re ready.<br>And when you are, signing up will grant you access to exclusive deals available only at Tappytoon.<br><br>\u25ba <b>Free tickets to try a new comic</b><br>Claim tickets to unlock even more chapters of comics, novels and webtoons that you might have missed.<br><br>\u25ba <b>Never miss a chapter</b><br>Subscribe to your favorite stories and we\u2019ll always let you know when a new chapter becomes available. Sort &amp; Filter in comics and novels in Daily, Genre, Library sections.<br> <br>Download now and jump right in to most vibrant comic, manhwa community!<br><br><b>Follow Tappytoon\u2122 on Instagram, Twitter(X), Tiktok, Facebook and YouTube! </b><br>- Instagram: https://instagram.com/Tappy_toon<br>- Twitter: https://twitter.com/Tappy_toon<br>- Tiktok: https://www.tiktok.com/@tappytoon_official<br>- Facebook: https://facebook.com/Tappytoon<br>- https://www.youtube.com/c/Tappytoon<br><br>*Time Till Free is available only on select eligible comics/chapters. <br>Eligibility may change at Tappytoon&#39;s discretion.<br><br>*Tappytoon Club Membership subscription automatically renews unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the current period ends. <br>Your account will be charged the same price for renewal within 24-hours <br>before the current subscription period ends. You can turn off auto-renewal at anytime. See the Tappytoon Club Membership page on app for more details.<br><br>Comics and webtoons are only available in English, French, German language at this time.<br>Novels (webnovels) are only available in English language at this time.<br>---<br>**Email support: support[@]tappytoon.com<br><br>Terms of Service: https://www.tappytoon.com/terms<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.tappytoon.com/terms/privacy<br>---<br>All content on Tappytoon is serviced in official partnership with the respective publishers, creators and artists. <br>\u00a9 Tappytoon\u2122 - All rights reserved.",
